 the left post after the ball breaks to him in the box. The score is 0:2."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"50'","type":"assist","side":"away","player":"Vanaken H.","score":"0:2","text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"56'","type":"yellow_card","side":"home","player":"Just E.","score":null,"text":"This yellow card was deserved. The tackle by Elijah Henry Just (New Zealand) was quite harsh and Adham Makhadmeh didn't hesitate to show him a yellow card."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"56'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Doku J.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"56'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","player":"Fernandez-Pardo M.","score":null,"text":"We are about to witness a subsitution. Matias Fernandez-Pardo (Belgium) for Jeremy Doku."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"64'","type":"sub_out","side":"home","player":"Payne T.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"64'","type":"sub_in","side":"home","player":"Boxall M.","score":null,"text":"The manager has decided to make a substitution and Tim Payne walks off the pitch to be replaced by Michael Boxall (New Zealand)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"64'","type":"sub_out","side":"home","player":"Bell J.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"64'","type":"sub_in","side":"home","player":"McCowatt C.","score":null,"text":"Darren Bazeley has decided to substitute Joe Bell and he is replaced by Callum McCowatt (New Zealand)."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"66'","type":"goal","side":"away","player":"De Bruyne K.","score":"0:3","text":"Kevin De Bruyne (Belgium) quickly gets to a rebound. He is not worried how far out he is and slams the ball towards the goal. To the amazement of all, it goes all the way into the bottom left corner. He makes it 0:3 with this magnificent strike."},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_out","side":"away","player":"Trossard L.","score":null,"text":null},{"period":"2nd Half","minute":"72'","type":"sub_in","side":"away","